WEBVTT

00:00:00.830 --> 00:00:37.185
[Ne engleski]

00:00:37.185 --> 00:00:40.478
... i to je jedna od stvari u kojima najviše uživam

00:00:40.478 --> 00:00:43.727
na ovom skupu.

00:00:43.727 --> 00:00:51.338
Nije toliko puno, koliko ima malo veze
sa svime što jeste.

00:00:51.338 --> 00:00:54.728
(Smeh)

00:00:54.728 --> 00:00:56.862
Ali je to u našem interesu

00:00:56.862 --> 00:00:59.578
da razumemo topografiju naših života

00:00:59.578 --> 00:01:01.596
u nas same.